  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Training on physical protection</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildning fysiskt skydd</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rst&#xE4;rka Ukrainas nationella och internationella ickespridningsinsatser. Syftet &#xE4;r att bidra till utveckling av akademiska utbildningsstrukturer inom nuclear security omr&#xE5;det. Aktiviteterna 2018 g&#xE4;ller en kartl&#xE4;ggning av motpartens behov, efterf&#xF6;ljande analys och identifiering av konkreta SSM insatser under 2018-2019.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal is to strengthen Ukraine&apos;s national and international nonproliferation efforts.  The aim is to contribute to the development of academic structures within the nuclear security area. In 2018 the work deals with mapping the needs of the counterpart, as well as a followin analysis and identification of concrete SSM-actions in 2018-19.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till etablering av akademiska utbildningsstrukturer inom nuclear security omr&#xE5;det vid Kiev tekniska institut.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to develop nuclear security university education program at the Kiev Polytechnical Institute.</narrative>
  </description>
